  "notes": "S\u00e3o Martinho S.A. (B3: SMTO3) \u2014 one of Brazil's largest sugar/ethanol producers. Four mills (S\u00e3o Martinho, Iracema, Santa Cruz, Boa Vista) primarily in S\u00e3o Paulo + Goi\u00e1s. Crushing capacity ~24 Mt cane/yr. Owns / controls ~165k hectares (~408k acres) of sugarcane area. FY ends MARCH 31 (e.g., FY24/25 = Apr 2024 \u2192 Mar 2025). All figures BRL-mm IFRS consolidated. Receita bruta \u2248 net revenue \u00d7 ~1.10 (PIS/COFINS, ICMS). Quarterly + segment data from SMTO ITR/DFP filings (ri.saomartinho.com.br). Segments: A\u00e7\u00facar (sugar), Etanol (ethanol \u2014 both anhydrous/hydrous), Cogera\u00e7\u00e3o (electric power from bagasse), Outros (Cana de fornecedores resold + biomass).",
